        <p>A good start is half the race. If you suffer from</p>
        <p>Breakfast-table Peevishness</p>
        <p>you commence all wrong. A world of meaning is contained in this phrase, and if the trouble arises from a torpid liver, impaired digestion or a "bad night," you will find a world of relief in a box of</p>
